  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Transport Infrastructure Restoration -  Fiji - Transport</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australian Infrastructure Financing Facility for the Pacific (AIFFP) is financing the renewal of more than 1.5 million square metres of road surface and upgrading and replacing nine key bridges to ensure Fiji&#x2019;s road infrastructure is climate resilient. This investment also supports institutional strengthening measures for the Fiji Roads Authority (FRA).</narrative>
  </description>
